--indent 4
--maxwidth 120
--semicolons never
--self remove
--commas inline
# Conflicts with SwiftLint's `opening_brace` rule (brace on the same line as the last condition, K&R
# style) for multiline if/guard conditions — SwiftFormat's default wants the brace on its own line
# (Allman style) for exactly that case. Found 2026-09-18 when a routine `swiftformat .` run introduced a
# SwiftLint violation in an unrelated file. Disabled here rather than changing `opening_brace` in
# .swiftlint.yml, since the rest of the codebase already consistently uses the same-line style.
--disable wrapMultilineStatementBraces
